// Named affix-pool sets. Items/monsters subscribe with `@name` in their
// `affix_pools`; the loader expands these in place (authoring-only — the
// runtime only ever sees real pool names). Grow a whole family's affix
// surface in one place here.
PoolSets([
    // The default armour kit: defensive rolls plus a little arcana.
    ("armour_default", ["armour", "arcana"]),
])
